    "brief": "Settings → General (the #settings-panel-general tab) at http://127.0.0.1:7391/",
    "briefText": "Run gui-improve again on the General settings tab, this time for real: the task text must allow the implement and correct stages to write in public/ and lib/ and to commit on a branch, the compare stage must take its after shots at the same viewports and states the baseline recorded, the review gate must be free to reject with a note, and the change must land by PR with the comparison page showing before, after and diff for every pair, so the improvement is code on main rather than a ledger entry.",
    "url": "http://127.0.0.1:7391/",
    "selector": "#settings-panel-general",
    "window": "#settings",
    "change": "each preset row must read as part of the control above it, and its pills must share one width",
    "changeSource": "Carried from the first gui-improve run on this tab (worktree add-generic-gui-pipeline-to-bundle-4c4680). public/style.css:438-441 is still the unmodified style in this tree, so that run's change never landed.",
    "reproduce": "The captured pixels are the served build's public/index.html, app.js and style.css (hashes in environment). To shoot the after state of an edit in this worktree, serve THIS worktree on a free port with its own PANEL_CONFIG (public/ is read per request; lib/ needs a restart) and follow the same steps at the same viewport. The 340x520 surfaceFile depends only on the public files, not on the live board behind the window.",
    "scope": "The whole Settings window (#settings): its head, search box, tab strip and the visible General panel. Hidden tabs are not painted and are excluded."
  },
